      claude: `Act as a product lead. Design the day-one feedback loop for a small web app: channel choices (embedded widget, mailto, public issue tracker) and their trust signals, form friction rules (one message field, optional contact), auto-attaching context (page, browser, actions before the error) with privacy care, and the response discipline that makes the loop real - triage within 48 hours and a closing reply. Under 16 lines.`,
