      lovable: `Add a minimal feedback widget to this site: a corner button opening a one-field message form with optional email, page URL and browser context attached automatically, submissions stored server-side with basic spam filtering, and the same feedback link offered on the 404 page and error states.`,
      generic: `Explain the day-one feedback loop: low-friction channels (widget, mailto, public tracker), one-field forms with optional contact, auto-attached context and privacy scrubbing, spam protection, triage discipline, and why visible responsiveness matters as much as collection. Contrast stated feedback with behavioural analytics.`,
